  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Joint Response 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the most urgent needs of the affected communities in Ethiopia, Tearfund UK, EKHC will provide WASH, FSL and MPC support to  affected HHs (55,000 people) in Midega Tola in East Haraghe region

In FSL 6,864 people provided with resources to protect and start rebuilding livelihood assets. 
In WASH: 3460 people have access to sufficient and safe water for domestic use 55,000 people reached with hygiene promotion/awareness raising activities.
With MPC 5,130 people benefitting from unconditional and unrestricted cash transfers.</narrative>
  </description>
